                                                                                                                                                 environment, an interim impairment test was triggered. The resulting analysis led to an approximately </FONT><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">$3,788 <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">million
                                                                                                                                                 write-down of goodwill. For more information, see our Quarterly Report on Form&nbsp;10-Q for the period ended March&nbsp;28,
                                                                                                                                                 2026.</FONT></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

